    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crooked</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύνα,
